@anon.3c5d4856225436a016f648d8ca8332b3.2677 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [363 x i8] }> <{ [363 x i8] c"# `intra-doc-pointers`\0A\0AThe tracking issue for this feature is: [#80896]\0A\0A[#80896]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/80896\0A\0A------------------------\0A\0ARustdoc does not currently allow disambiguating between `*const` and `*mut`, and\0Araw pointers in intra-doc links are unstable until it does.\0A\0A```rust\0A#![feature(intra_doc_pointers)]\0A//! [pointer::add]\0A```\0A" }>, align 1
